# Default-deny: only reviewed source, configurations, tests, and docs are tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!pyproject.toml
!requirements-transformer.txt
!bimuon/
!bimuon/**
!experiments/
!experiments/**
!configs/
!configs/*.json
!tests/
!tests/*.py
!docs/
!docs/*.md
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pt
*.pth
*.npz
*.npy
*.csv
*.log
*.zip
*.pdf
*.png
.env*
.DS_Store
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
**/environment*.json
**/metadata.json
**/*manifest*.json
**/credentials*
**/secrets*
